        "checksum": "f6024a9537b6e8515257d61af40d4095cb6613536ee72a85b16fc5f329d8e4f2_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggWRoQI2K_D_text": "FAQs",
        "ggBOIbE9tXC_text": "<p>Got questions? We’ve got answer...</p>",
        "ggGRMYFEc-I_childItem_0": "<p>How long does the battery last on a single charge?</p>",
        "ggGRMYFEc-I_childItem_1": "<p>Can I take Gsmile when I travel?</p>",
        "ggGRMYFEc-I_childItem_2": "<p>Is Gsmile safe for sensitive gums?</p>",
        "ggGRMYFEc-I_childItem_3": "<p>How many nozzles come with the Gsmile water flosser?</p>",
        "ggGRMYFEc-I_childItem_4": "<p>Does it remove plaque better than traditional floss?</p>",
        "ggGRMYFEc-I_childItem_5": "<p>How often should I use the Gsmile water flosser?</p>",
        "gg1Ovdn3ezF_text": "<p>The rechargeable battery lasts up to 30 minutes of continuous use, enough for multiple sessions.</p>",
        "ggD2WDv80hi_text": "<p>Yes! Its compact, lightweight design makes it perfect for travel and easy to pack.</p>",
        "ggdLseVBeKv_text": "<p>Absolutely. The water pressure is gentle yet effective, suitable even for sensitive gums.</p>",
        "gg9487Pj5C1_text": "<p>Gsmile comes with 3 ready-to-use tips, which can be swapped easily for different needs.</p>",
        "ggiygJVPX4J_text": "<p>Yes, the targeted water jet reaches tight spaces and removes plaque more effectively than string floss.</p>",
        "ggur6bbjHEM_text": "<p>For optimal oral health, use Gsmile once daily, ideally before bedtime, for cleaner teeth and healthier gums.</p>"
      }
